<title>USA: AnnTaylor Stores Q4 net shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>AnnTaylor Stores Q4 net shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net Shr profit	   $0.12     loss	 $0.05</p>
<p> Oper Shr profit	   0.20     loss	  0.05</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,966     loss	 1,244</p>
<p> Net Sales		213,118		  200,641</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,635		   23,178</p>
<p>	  YEAR</p>
<p> Net Shr Profit	   $0.36     loss	 $0.04</p>
<p> Oper Shr Profit	   0.53     loss	  0.04</p>
<p> Net profit		 8,667     loss	   876</p>
<p> Net Sales		798,117		  731,142</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,104		   23,209</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company recorded a Q4 1996 charge related to the decision to close all nine Ann Taylor Studio stand alone shoe stores during 1997. The charge of about $2 million after tax or $0.08 per share is to cover the write off of the net book value of the nine stores, projected operating losses in these stores prior to closing, estimated lease liabilities and related costs.</p>
<p>In Q3 1996 the company recorded a charge of about $2 million after tax, or $0.08 per share related to the company's obligations under the former chairperson's employment contract.</p>
</text>
